# Day 07 – Personal Contact Book

## About the Project
A beginner-friendly, menu-driven Python application for managing personal contacts.

## Features
- Add new contacts
- View all contacts
- Search for contacts
- Update phone numbers
- Delete contacts
- Validate phone numbers
- Exit the application

## Python Concepts Used
- Dictionaries
- While loops
- If-elif-else statements
- User input and output
- String methods (`lower()`, `strip()`)
- Dictionary methods (`items()`)
- Input validation

## How to Run
1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the Python file in VS Code.
3. Run the program.

## What I Learned
I learned how to use dictionaries to store contact information and how to build a menu-driven application using loops and conditional statements.

